跃的夏日出游氛围，视觉焦点突出且信息层次清晰。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 16, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 17, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [22], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [138.498291015625, 732.426513671875], "widgets_values": ["色调艳丽，过曝，静态，细节模糊不清，字幕，风格，作品，画作，画面，静止，整体发灰，最差质量，低质量，jpeg压缩残留，丑陋的，多余的手指，画得不好的手指，画得不好的脸部，畸形的，毁容的，形态畸形的肢体，手指融合，静止不动的画面，杂乱的背景，三条腿，背景人很多，倒着走，黑白"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 18, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 16, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [34], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [140, 46], "pos": [806.427734375, 523.603271484375], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 13, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 14, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "any", "links": [43], "label": "any", "type": "*", "localized_name": "any"}], "size": [279.6304626464844, 82], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [783.4750366210938, 730.7914428710938], "widgets_values": [true, true], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 34, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "